flowchart TD
  START([Start]) --> recover[recover]
  recover --> intent[classify intent]

  intent -->|allowed| llm[llm]
  intent -->|not allowed| rejection[reject question]

  rejection --> response[build response]

  llm -->|tool_calls| tools[tools]
  tools --> llm
  llm -->|no tool_calls| response

  response --> save[save answer]
  save --> END([End])